        "sourceTitle": "ARC Prize — ARC-AGI-3 Milestone 1 results",
        "sourceUrl": "https://arcprize.org/blog/arc-prize-2026-milestone-1",
        "text": "ARC Prize named Tufa Labs and its Duck agent the first-place open-source solution for the June 2026 ARC-AGI-3 Milestone 1 prize."
      },
      {
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-08T13:46:44Z",
        "sourceTitle": "Tufa Labs — Duck Harness technical overview",
        "sourceUrl": "https://tufalabs.ai/research/duck-harness/",
        "text": "Tufa Labs says its public Duck harness lets an LLM inspect game grids as image and text, write Python in a REPL, and keep context short by evicting older messages. This describes the published Milestone 1 system, not an unverified current submission."
      },
      {
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-08T13:46:44Z",
        "sourceTitle": "Tufa Labs — team profiles",
        "sourceUrl": "https://tufalabs.ai/team/",
        "text": "Tufa Labs lists Dries Smit, Isaiah Pressman and Jeroen Cottaar among its AI researchers, with research interests spanning reinforcement learning, self-play and Bayesian methods."
      },
      {
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-09T17:16:30Z",
        "sourceTitle": "Tufa Labs — October 9 public competition post",
        "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/tufalabs/status/2108463895128269084",
        "text": "On October 9, 2026, Tufa Labs described a temporary setback in a public X post and said it remained dedicated to crushing competitors with overwhelming resources and compute."
      }
